[00:24.4100]Getting lost in the sound of our hearts beating (在彼此的心跳声中迷失)
[00:30.2300]Take me here, take me now (就在此地，就在此刻，带我出发)
[00:32.1890]Getting lost in a crowd with you (随你消逝在人山人海中)
[00:38.0100]
[00:38.8300]Up, all night (尽兴到整夜)
